{
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "where",
      "line_id": "wh-1",
      "filename": "where-wh-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/where-wh-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.32,
      "size": 69120,
      "text": "前面几课一直在用旋转：旋转矩阵、四元数、SO(3) 的拓扑。但有个问题一直没问：这些旋转本身是从哪来的？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "where",
      "line_id": "wh-2",
      "filename": "where-wh-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/where-wh-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.62,
      "size": 41904,
      "text": "答案是，它们是从无穷小旋转指数出来的。这门课讲的就是这台机器。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "where",
      "line_id": "wh-3",
      "filename": "where-wh-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/where-wh-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.29,
      "size": 68688,
      "text": "先看什么叫无穷小旋转。取一条从单位阵出发的旋转曲线，在起点求导，得到一个矩阵。这个矩阵就是切向量。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "where",
      "line_id": "wh-4",
      "filename": "where-wh-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/where-wh-4.mp3",
      "duration": 5.44,
      "size": 86976,
      "text": "它长什么样？旋转矩阵满足 R 转置乘 R 等于单位阵。两边对参数求导，在起点代入 R 等于单位阵，立刻得到：导数的转置加上导数等于零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "where",
      "line_id": "wh-5",
      "filename": "where-wh-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/where-wh-5.mp3",
      "duration": 5.17,
      "size": 82800,
      "text": "也就是说，切向量必须是反对称矩阵。全体三阶反对称矩阵组成的空间，就叫 so(3)，小写。它是 SO(3) 这个群在单位元处的切空间。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "hat",
      "line_id": "ha-1",
      "filename": "hat-ha-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/hat-ha-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.28,
      "size": 68544,
      "text": "三阶反对称矩阵，对角线必须是零，上三角决定下三角，所以只有三个自由参数。三个数，正好装成一个向量。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "hat",
      "line_id": "ha-2",
      "filename": "hat-ha-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/hat-ha-2.mp3",
      "duration": 5.55,
      "size": 88848,
      "text": "把向量 ω 摆成矩阵的这个操作叫 hat 映射，写成 ω 加个方括号叉。摆法是固定的：ω 的三个分量分别填到三个反对称的位置上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "hat",
      "line_id": "ha-3",
      "filename": "hat-ha-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/hat-ha-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.78,
      "size": 76464,
      "text": "这样摆有个好处，也是它唯一正确的摆法：hat 出来的矩阵乘以任何向量 v，结果恰好等于 ω 叉乘 v。叉积变成了矩阵乘法。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "hat",
      "line_id": "ha-4",
      "filename": "hat-ha-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/hat-ha-4.mp3",
      "duration": 4.66,
      "size": 74592,
      "text": "于是 so(3) 里的元素有了直观意义：ω 就是角速度。方向是转轴，长度是转速。画面左边那根粉色箭头，画的就是它。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "exp",
      "line_id": "ex-1",
      "filename": "exp-ex-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/exp-ex-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.86,
      "size": 61776,
      "text": "现在把切空间里的元素送回群里。用的是矩阵指数：把标量指数的幂级数照抄一遍，把里面的数换成矩阵。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "exp",
      "line_id": "ex-2",
      "filename": "exp-ex-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/exp-ex-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.35,
      "size": 69552,
      "text": "单位阵，加上 A，加上 A 平方除以二的阶乘，加上 A 立方除以三的阶乘，一直加下去。对任何方阵这个级数都收敛。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "exp",
      "line_id": "ex-3",
      "filename": "exp-ex-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/exp-ex-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.61,
      "size": 73728,
      "text": "但 so(3) 有个特别的地方，让这个无穷级数能收成一个有限的式子。设 K 是单位轴的 hat，直接算会发现：K 的三次方等于负 K。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "exp",
      "line_id": "ex-4",
      "filename": "exp-ex-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/exp-ex-4.mp3",
      "duration": 4.77,
      "size": 76320,
      "text": "这意味着幂级数每三项就折回去了。奇数次幂全是 K 的倍数，攒起来是正弦；偶数次幂全是 K 平方的倍数，攒起来是一减余弦。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "exp",
      "line_id": "ex-5",
      "filename": "exp-ex-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/exp-ex-5.mp3",
      "duration": 5.34,
      "size": 85392,
      "text": "于是得到 Rodrigues 公式：单位阵，加上 sin θ 乘 K，加上一减 cos θ 乘 K 平方。三项，完了。θ 就是 ω 的长度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "exp",
      "line_id": "ex-6",
      "filename": "exp-ex-6.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/exp-ex-6.mp3",
      "duration": 8.02,
      "size": 128304,
      "text": "要强调的是，这不是近似，是那个无穷级数的精确求和。切到「闭式对级数」那个模式可以验证：θ 等于 π 时，级数取四项差了整整二点零，取八项还差零点零七五，取三十项才降到十的负十六次方 —— 而闭式一步到位。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "oneparam",
      "line_id": "on-1",
      "filename": "oneparam-on-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/oneparam-on-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.47,
      "size": 71568,
      "text": "固定一个 ω，让 t 从零往上走，exp(t ω) 就在 SO(3) 里划出一条曲线。画面右边的物体转的就是它。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "oneparam",
      "line_id": "on-2",
      "filename": "oneparam-on-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/oneparam-on-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.04,
      "size": 64656,
      "text": "这条曲线是个子群：先转 s 再转 t，等于直接转 s 加 t。因为轴始终不变，两次旋转的角度可以直接相加。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "oneparam",
      "line_id": "on-3",
      "filename": "oneparam-on-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/oneparam-on-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.81,
      "size": 76896,
      "text": "注意左边的箭头。t 变大时它只是变长，方向不动 —— 切空间里走的是一条直线。而右边的物体在转圈，走的是群里的一条曲线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "oneparam",
      "line_id": "on-4",
      "filename": "oneparam-on-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/oneparam-on-4.mp3",
      "duration": 7.16,
      "size": 114624,
      "text": "指数映射干的就是这件事：把切空间里的直线，掰成群里的曲线。这也是为什么在 SLAM 和位姿优化里，大家宁可在 so(3) 上做加法，再 exp 回去 —— 直线上做优化比在带约束的矩阵流形上容易得多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "bracket",
      "line_id": "br-1",
      "filename": "bracket-br-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/bracket-br-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.55,
      "size": 40752,
      "text": "刚才说同一根轴可以相加。那不同轴呢？切到「李括号」模式看看。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "bracket",
      "line_id": "br-2",
      "filename": "bracket-br-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/bracket-br-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.25,
      "size": 67968,
      "text": "左边是先绕 A 转再绕 B 转，右边是先 B 后 A。两个物体的姿态明显不一样。三维旋转不可交换，这是老生常谈。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "bracket",
      "line_id": "br-3",
      "filename": "bracket-br-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/bracket-br-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.68,
      "size": 58896,
      "text": "但李代数把这件事量化了。定义李括号：A 乘 B 减去 B 乘 A。如果两个矩阵可交换，括号就是零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "bracket",
      "line_id": "br-4",
      "filename": "bracket-br-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/bracket-br-4.mp3",
      "duration": 4.18,
      "size": 66816,
      "text": "在 so(3) 上算一下会发现一个漂亮的结果：两个 hat 矩阵的李括号，正好是它们对应向量叉积的 hat。括号就是叉积。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "bracket",
      "line_id": "br-5",
      "filename": "bracket-br-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/bracket-br-5.mp3",
      "duration": 4.73,
      "size": 75744,
      "text": "这就把\"为什么旋转不可交换\"说透了：因为叉积不为零。两根轴平行时叉积为零，那时确实可以换序，这和刚才的单参数子群对上了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "bracket",
      "line_id": "br-6",
      "filename": "bracket-br-6.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/bracket-br-6.mp3",
      "duration": 7.81,
      "size": 124992,
      "text": "还可以更定量。exp(A) 乘 exp(B) 一般不等于 exp(A 加 B)，差多少？BCH 公式说，一阶修正就是二分之一的李括号。实测：加上这项之后，误差从千分之二降到万分之零点六，小了一个量级还多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "use",
      "line_id": "us-1",
      "filename": "use-us-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/use-us-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.63,
      "size": 74016,
      "text": "机器人学里，每个关节对应一个旋量，整条机械臂的正运动学就是一串指数连乘，叫指数积公式。比一层层拼欧拉角干净得多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "use",
      "line_id": "us-2",
      "filename": "use-us-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/use-us-2.mp3",
      "duration": 5.4,
      "size": 86400,
      "text": "SLAM 和位姿图优化里，位姿的增量放在 so(3) 里做，做完 exp 回群。因为 so(3) 是个普通的三维线性空间，梯度下降、高斯牛顿都能直接用。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "use",
      "line_id": "us-3",
      "filename": "use-us-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/use-us-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.07,
      "size": 49104,
      "text": "刚体动力学里，角速度本来就住在 so(3) 里。欧拉方程写成李代数的语言会短很多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "use",
      "line_id": "us-4",
      "filename": "use-us-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/use-us-4.mp3",
      "duration": 5.7,
      "size": 91152,
      "text": "再往前一步，同样的构造用在二阶酉群上给出 su(2)。而 su(2) 与 so(3) 的关系，正是上一课讲的双重覆盖 —— 两个李代数其实同构，差别只在群的整体拓扑上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.38,
      "size": 70128,
      "text": "so(3) 是 SO(3) 在单位元处的切空间，就是全体反对称矩阵；hat 映射把它等同于三维向量，矩阵乘法等同于叉积。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.68,
      "size": 58896,
      "text": "指数映射把切空间送回群。因为 K 的三次方等于负 K，无穷级数精确地收成 Rodrigues 的三项公式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.3,
      "size": 52848,
      "text": "李括号在 so(3) 上就是叉积，它度量了旋转的不可交换程度，也是 BCH 展开的一阶修正项。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "lie-algebra-so3",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-4",
      "filename": "summary-sum-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/lie-algebra-so3/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-4.mp3",
      "duration": 0.9,
      "size": 14400,
      "text": "继续探索数学之美！"
    }
  ],
